[I] Command-line to-do list manager

[T] Taskwarrior is a command line task list management utility with a
[T] multitude of features such as projects, tags, priorities, due dates,
[T] recurrence and reports. It is a portable open source project with a
[T] large ecosystem of tools, hooks and extensions.

[U] https://taskwarrior.org

